---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { COMPANY, getPhoneLink } from '../config/company';
---

<Layout 
  title="How to Choose a Qualified Intermediary | 1031 Exchange QI Guide"
  description="Learn how to select the right Qualified Intermediary for your 1031 exchange. Compare QI services, security measures, fees, and what questions to ask before choosing."
>
  
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="bg-gradient-to-b from-blue-50 to-white py-16">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">
          Choosing the Right Qualified Intermediary
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-8">
          Your Qualified Intermediary is the cornerstone of a successful 1031 exchange. 
          Learn what to look for, what questions to ask, and how to protect your investment 
          when selecting a QI to handle your tax-deferred exchange.
        </p>
        
        <!-- CTA Buttons -->
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
          <a href="/contact" 
             class="bg-yellow-400 text-blue-900 px-8 py-4 rounded-lg text-lg font-semibold hover:bg-yellow-300 transition-all duration-300 transform hover:scale-105 shadow-lg">
            Talk to Our QI Experts
          </a>
          <a href="/start-exchange" 
             class="border-2 border-blue-600 text-blue-600 px-8 py-4 rounded-lg text-lg font-semibold hover:bg-blue-600 hover:text-white transition-all duration-300">
            Start Your Exchange
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <!-- Trust Indicators -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-lg p-8 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4 text-center">Why QI Selection Matters</h2>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 text-center">
          <div>
            <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-red-600">$2B+</div>
            <div class="text-gray-600">Lost to QI Fraud Since 2000</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-blue-600">180</div>
            <div class="text-gray-600">Days Your Funds Are Held</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-green-600">100%</div>
            <div class="text-gray-600">Protection with Right QI</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <!-- What is a QI Section -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8">What is a Qualified Intermediary?</h2>
      
      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-gray-600">
        <p class="mb-6">
          A Qualified Intermediary (QI), also called an Exchange Accommodator or Exchange Facilitator, 
          is an independent third party that facilitates 1031 exchanges by holding the proceeds from 
          your property sale and using them to purchase your replacement property.
        </p>
        
        <div class="bg-blue-50 border-l-4 border-blue-400 p-6 rounded-lg mb-8">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Why You Need a QI</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700">
            IRS regulations require that you never have actual or constructive receipt of the exchange 
            funds. If you touch the money—even for a moment—your entire exchange is disqualified and 
            becomes immediately taxable. A QI ensures this critical requirement is met.
          </p>
        </div>
        
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">Key QI Responsibilities</h3>
        
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          <div class="bg-gray-50 p-6 rounded-lg">
            <h4 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">Legal & Documentation</h4>
            <ul class="space-y-2">
              <li>• Prepare exchange agreements</li>
              <li>• Document property identification</li>
              <li>• Ensure IRS compliance</li>
              <li>• Provide tax reporting forms</li>
              <li>• Maintain exchange records</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          
          <div class="bg-gray-50 p-6 rounded-lg">
            <h4 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">Financial Management</h4>
            <ul class="space-y-2">
              <li>• Receive sale proceeds</li>
              <li>• Hold funds securely</li>
              <li>• Track interest earnings</li>
              <li>• Disburse for purchases</li>
              <li>• Handle multiple properties</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <!-- Critical Security Features -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-gray-50">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8">Critical Security Features to Require</h2>
      
      <div class="bg-red-50 border-l-4 border-red-400 p-6 rounded-lg mb-8">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Warning: QI Industry is Unregulated</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700">
          Unlike banks or brokerages, Qualified Intermediaries are not federally regulated. Anyone can 
          claim to be a QI. This makes your due diligence critical to protecting your funds.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <!-- Segregated Accounts -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md p-6">
          <div class="flex items-start">
            <div class="bg-green-100 rounded-full p-3 mr-4 flex-shrink-0">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-green-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Segregated Client Accounts</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-600 mb-3">
                Your funds should NEVER be commingled with the QI's operating funds or other clients' money. 
                Each client should have a separate, segregated account.
              </p>
              <div class="bg-green-50 p-4 rounded-lg">
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">
                  <strong>Ask for proof:</strong> Request documentation showing how client funds are segregated 
                  and protected from any claims against the QI company.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Fidelity Bond -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md p-6">
          <div class="flex items-start">
            <div class="bg-blue-100 rounded-full p-3 mr-4 flex-shrink-0">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-blue-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.031 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Fidelity Bond & Insurance</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-600 mb-3">
                A fidelity bond protects against employee theft and fraud. Errors & Omissions insurance 
                covers mistakes. Both are essential for protecting your exchange.
              </p>
              <div class="bg-blue-50 p-4 rounded-lg">
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">
                  <strong>Minimum coverage:</strong> Look for at least $1 million in fidelity bond coverage 
                  and $1 million in E&O insurance. Larger QIs often carry much more.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Banking Relationships -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md p-6">
          <div class="flex items-start">
            <div class="bg-purple-100 rounded-full p-3 mr-4 flex-shrink-0">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-purple-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 21V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v16m14 0h2m-2 0h-5m-9 0H3m2 0h5M9 7h1m-1 4h1m4-4h1m-1 4h1m-5 10v-5a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v5m-4 0h4"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">FDIC-Insured Banking</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-600 mb-3">
                Exchange funds should be held in FDIC-insured bank accounts at reputable institutions. 
                Multiple banking relationships provide additional security.
              </p>
              <div class="bg-purple-50 p-4 rounded-lg">
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">
                  <strong>Verify:</strong> Ask which banks they use and how funds are protected. Legitimate 
                  QIs will readily share this information.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <!-- Questions to Ask -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8">Essential Questions to Ask Any QI</h2>
      
      <div class="space-y-8">
        <!-- Security Questions -->
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">Security & Protection</h3>
          <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-6">
            <ol class="space-y-4">
              <li class="flex items-start">
                <span class="font-bold text-blue-600 mr-3">1.</span>
                <div>
                  <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900">How are client funds protected?</p>
                  <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm mt-1">Look for: Segregated accounts, separate from operating funds</p>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start">
                <span class="font-bold text-blue-600 mr-3">2.</span>
                <div>
                  <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900">What insurance coverage do you carry?</p>
                  <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm mt-1">Look for: Fidelity bond of $1M+, E&O insurance, cyber liability</p>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start">
                <span class="font-bold text-blue-600 mr-3">3.</span>
                <div>
                  <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900">Which banks hold client funds?</p>
                  <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm mt-1">Look for: Major FDIC-insured banks, multiple relationships</p>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start">
                <span class="font-bold text-blue-600 mr-3">4.</span>
                <div>
                  <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900">Can I audit my account during the exchange?</p>
                  <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm mt-1">Look for: Online access, regular statements, transparency</p>
                </div>
              </li>
            </ol>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Experience Questions -->
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">Experience & Track Record</h3>
          <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-6">
            <ol class="space-y-4" start="5">
              <li class="flex items-start">
                <span class="font-bold text-green-600 mr-3">5.</span>
                <div>
                  <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900">How long have you been in business?</p>
                  <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm mt-1">Look for: 10+ years, stable ownership, growth history</p>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start">
                <span class="font-bold text-green-600 mr-3">6.</span>
                <div>
                  <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900">How many exchanges have you completed?</p>
                  <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm mt-1">Look for: Thousands of successful exchanges, all types</p>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start">
                <span class="font-bold text-green-600 mr-3">7.</span>
                <div>
                  <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900">What types of exchanges do you handle?</p>
                  <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm mt-1">Look for: All types including reverse and improvement</p>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start">
                <span class="font-bold text-green-600 mr-3">8.</span>
                <div>
                  <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900">Can you provide references?</p>
                  <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm mt-1">Look for: CPAs, attorneys, recent clients willing to speak</p>
                </div>
              </li>
            </ol>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Service Questions -->
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">Service & Support</h3>
          <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-6">
            <ol class="space-y-4" start="9">
              <li class="flex items-start">
                <span class="font-bold text-purple-600 mr-3">9.</span>
                <div>
                  <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900">Who will handle my exchange?</p>
                  <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm mt-1">Look for: Dedicated coordinator, not just call center</p>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start">
                <span class="font-bold text-purple-600 mr-3">10.</span>
                <div>
                  <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900">What are your hours and response times?</p>
                  <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm mt-1">Look for: Extended hours, 24-48 hour response guarantee</p>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start">
                <span class="font-bold text-purple-600 mr-3">11.</span>
                <div>
                  <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900">How do you handle complex situations?</p>
                  <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm mt-1">Look for: In-house expertise, attorney access, problem-solving</p>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start">
                <span class="font-bold text-purple-600 mr-3">12.</span>
                <div>
                  <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900">What technology do you offer?</p>
                  <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm mt-1">Look for: Online portal, document upload, tracking tools</p>
                </div>
              </li>
            </ol>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <!-- Red Flags Section -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-red-50">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8">Red Flags to Avoid</h2>
      
      <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-lg p-8">
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 mb-6">
          These warning signs should make you think twice about using a QI:
        </p>
        
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          <div class="space-y-4">
            <div class="flex items-start">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-red-500 mt-1 mr-3 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M18 10a8 8 0 11-16 0 8 8 0 0116 0zm-7 4a1 1 0 11-2 0 1 1 0 012 0zm-1-9a1 1 0 00-1 1v4a1 1 0 102 0V6a1 1 0 00-1-1z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path>
              </svg>
              <div>
                <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900">Commingled Funds</p>
                <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">Client money mixed with operating accounts</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="flex items-start">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-red-500 mt-1 mr-3 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M18 10a8 8 0 11-16 0 8 8 0 0116 0zm-7 4a1 1 0 11-2 0 1 1 0 012 0zm-1-9a1 1 0 00-1 1v4a1 1 0 102 0V6a1 1 0 00-1-1z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path>
              </svg>
              <div>
                <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900">No Insurance</p>
                <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">Lack of fidelity bond or E&O coverage</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="flex items-start">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-red-500 mt-1 mr-3 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M18 10a8 8 0 11-16 0 8 8 0 0116 0zm-7 4a1 1 0 11-2 0 1 1 0 012 0zm-1-9a1 1 0 00-1 1v4a1 1 0 102 0V6a1 1 0 00-1-1z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path>
              </svg>
              <div>
                <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900">Unusually Low Fees</p>
                <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">May indicate corner-cutting on security</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="flex items-start">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-red-500 mt-1 mr-3 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M18 10a8 8 0 11-16 0 8 8 0 0116 0zm-7 4a1 1 0 11-2 0 1 1 0 012 0zm-1-9a1 1 0 00-1 1v4a1 1 0 102 0V6a1 1 0 00-1-1z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path>
              </svg>
              <div>
                <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900">Pressure Tactics</p>
                <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">Rushing you to sign without questions</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <div class="space-y-4">
            <div class="flex items-start">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-red-500 mt-1 mr-3 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M18 10a8 8 0 11-16 0 8 8 0 0116 0zm-7 4a1 1 0 11-2 0 1 1 0 012 0zm-1-9a1 1 0 00-1 1v4a1 1 0 102 0V6a1 1 0 00-1-1z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path>
              </svg>
              <div>
                <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900">Limited Experience</p>
                <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">New company or few completed exchanges</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="flex items-start">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-red-500 mt-1 mr-3 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M18 10a8 8 0 11-16 0 8 8 0 0116 0zm-7 4a1 1 0 11-2 0 1 1 0 012 0zm-1-9a1 1 0 00-1 1v4a1 1 0 102 0V6a1 1 0 00-1-1z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path>
              </svg>
              <div>
                <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900">No Physical Address</p>
                <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">Only PO Box or virtual office</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="flex items-start">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-red-500 mt-1 mr-3 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M18 10a8 8 0 11-16 0 8 8 0 0116 0zm-7 4a1 1 0 11-2 0 1 1 0 012 0zm-1-9a1 1 0 00-1 1v4a1 1 0 102 0V6a1 1 0 00-1-1z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path>
              </svg>
              <div>
                <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900">Won't Provide References</p>
                <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">Unwilling to share client testimonials</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="flex items-start">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-red-500 mt-1 mr-3 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M18 10a8 8 0 11-16 0 8 8 0 0116 0zm-7 4a1 1 0 11-2 0 1 1 0 012 0zm-1-9a1 1 0 00-1 1v4a1 1 0 102 0V6a1 1 0 00-1-1z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path>
              </svg>
              <div>
                <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900">Complex Fee Structure</p>
                <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">Hidden fees or confusing pricing</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <!-- Fee Structure Section -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8">Understanding QI Fees</h2>
      
      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-gray-600 mb-8">
        <p>
          Qualified Intermediary fees vary based on exchange complexity, property values, and service levels. 
          Understanding typical fee structures helps you evaluate proposals and avoid surprises.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-8">
        <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-6">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">Standard Exchange Fees</h3>
          <div class="space-y-3">
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <span class="text-gray-600">Basic Delayed Exchange</span>
              <span class="font-semibold">$750 - $1,500</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <span class="text-gray-600">Each Additional Property</span>
              <span class="font-semibold">$200 - $500</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <span class="text-gray-600">Reverse Exchange Setup</span>
              <span class="font-semibold">$3,500 - $7,500</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <span class="text-gray-600">Improvement Exchange</span>
              <span class="font-semibold">$2,500 - $5,000+</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-6">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">Additional Services</h3>
          <div class="space-y-3">
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <span class="text-gray-600">Document Preparation</span>
              <span class="font-semibold">Often Included</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <span class="text-gray-600">Wire Transfer Fees</span>
              <span class="font-semibold">$35 - $75</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <span class="text-gray-600">Interest on Funds</span>
              <span class="font-semibold">Varies by QI</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <span class="text-gray-600">Consulting Services</span>
              <span class="font-semibold">$150 - $300/hr</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="bg-yellow-50 border-l-4 border-yellow-400 p-6 rounded-lg">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Fee Considerations</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-700">
          <li>• Lowest price isn't always best—consider security and service</li>
          <li>• Ask about all fees upfront to avoid surprises</li>
          <li>• Some QIs share interest earned on your funds</li>
          <li>• Complex exchanges justify higher fees for expertise</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <!-- Comparison Checklist -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-gray-50">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8">QI Comparison Checklist</h2>
      
      <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-lg p-8">
        <p class="text-gray-600 mb-6">
